                "result": {
                  "params": {
                    "domain": "notify",
                    "service": "persistent_notification",
                    "service_data": {
                      "message": "Set: 22.0C Mode: cool Fans: kitchen=1, master=2, mina=2, guest=2, izaan=3 Vents: Iz=80% Mi=50% Blinds: {\"dining\":25,\"family\":100,\"living\":100,\"mina\":100} - Weekend off-peak electricity rates are active. The second floor is warmer (perceived 23.4C) compared to the main floor (perceived 21.5C). Keeping HVAC in cool mode at 22.0C setpoint. Partially closing dining blinds (25% open) to block direct sun from the west (azimuth 272.5 vs dining 247). Opening other blinds to 100%. Running upstairs ceiling fans and vent boosters to balance the thermal gradient.",
                      "title": "Climate AI: 22.0C cool"
