                    "service": "persistent_notification",
                    "service_data": {
                      "message": "Set: 22.0C Mode: cool Fans: kitchen=1, master=2, mina=2, guest=1, izaan=2 Vents: Iz=80% Mi=50% Blinds: {\"dining\":0,\"family\":100,\"living\":100,\"mina\":100} - It is a warm summer Saturday evening. Outdoor temperature (24.2C) is warmer than indoor, so we continue cooling to 22.0C. High humidity (63%) on the upper floor makes it feel warmer (Up=23.1C), so ceiling fans and vent boosters are active to cool upstairs rooms. Blinds in the dining room are closed (0%) to block solar heat from the setting sun (azimuth 275.12 deg), while other non-sunny side blinds are opened.",
                      "title": "Climate AI: 22.0C cool"
