                    "service": "mobile_app_cph2655",
                    "service_data": {
                      "message": "Climate AI: Set 22.0C cool Fans: kitchen=1, master=2, mina=2, guest=1, izaan=2 - It is a warm summer Saturday evening. Outdoor temperature (24.2C) is warmer than indoor, so we continue cooling to 22.0C. High humidity (63%) on the upper floor makes it feel warmer (Up=23.1C), so ceiling fans and vent boosters are active to cool upstairs rooms. Blinds in the dining room are closed (0%) to block solar heat from the setting sun (azimuth 275.12 deg), while other non-sunny side blinds are opened.",
                      "title": "Climate AI"
